    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index fell 335 points from the previous week to 4,830 points. While SSY’s assessed Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate decreased $0.60/t to $7.70/t, below the July average, the Pacific roundvoyage rate fell $2,000/day from the previous week to $10,000/day, lowest since March.",
